          "git_sha": "41f9585ab8695d00f4679532e34c892243e78159",
          "line_end": 19,
          "line_start": 19,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "anipotts/coding-agent-tips",
          "url": "https://github.com/anipotts/coding-agent-tips/blob/be596c140cafa5d19386f2e72ed80c564b4de2d6/README.md#L19-L19"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d9e4d4bcd95bdd7f96d5c51320432c2a27cbd6a48f82ecba937a7530e6c6ad26"
      ],
      "text": "The handbook's framework separates the steering surface, the harness running the agent loop, the inference model, and orchestration for parallel work, and also covers permissions, review, and operating costs."
    },
