        "slc_4ac638ef1421f6f6da6107c628841b1fa07e4355d37ad12596d788e7878fc601"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: contributors must run source, Astro, generated-route, Markdown, and shell checks before broad changes, plus bun and pytest test suites for archive or shared-runtime changes."
    },
